 "_doc": "The list of 2026-11-12's third phase: twenty kinds of ruins (docs/improvements12.txt). 924 ruins writes 'pieces' into the generator's WildPieces as r12_<name>#<n> and 'kinds' into WildRuinKinds (RDWildRuin12.cpp lays them). A part is 'key=value;...': L the layout (at, ring, arc (ring with span), tiers, line, rect, grid, scatter), p a piece prefix (r12_<name># of this table, or a places' table piece: house, log, bones, fence, tent...), box a container piece (the dungeon's Chest) instead, n / n2 counts, r / r2 radius or length / width (m), r0 an inner radius, x y z an offset in the place's frame (m; z a lift), a the layout's angle (deg), span (deg), dr dz sp a tiers' row step, depth step and spacing, h a piece's height (m, 'lo-hi' a range) or s its scale, sx sy sz stretches, sink (cm of the piece as laid with h; cm of the mesh before scaling with s), yaw (along, face, out, tangent, rand, fixed) and yawadd yawjit, tilt (deg each way), lie=1 laid on its side, keep (each piece's chance), jit (m), col=0 no collision, wild=1 laid as the villages lay their pieces (a house with its inside), land=1 from the place's own point. Meshes were looked at in pictures before being named (the survey of 2026-11-12); FrozenNorse's draw grey here and are left out.",
